17. SECRETS MODEL
================================================================================

MVP secret stance:
- no plaintext secret values in Git
- secret references only in config/specs
- native Kubernetes Secrets acceptable for MVP/POC
- allow future path to ExternalSecrets or Vault

Reference format example:
- `ref:my-secret.MY_KEY`

Secret inputs in template forms must support reference mode.
Do NOT default to plaintext freeform secret entry in Git-backed specs.

For MVP:
- safe enough
- no fake enterprise claims
- clear future path

